    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String baseUri = "https://example.com";
        List<String> titles = getTitles(baseUri);
        for (String title : titles) {
            System.out.println(title);
        }
    }

    public static List<String> getTitles(String baseUri) {
        Document document = generateDocument(baseUri);
        return document.select("h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6").map(String::trim).toList();
    }
}
```

This code connects to the base URL, gets the HTML content of the page, and selects all headings (h1-h6) on the page using the `select()` method. The result is a list of headings.

